# Generated by scripts/fetch_amedas_obsdl.py: the raw obsdl CSVs. Large
# (100s of MB for the full storm set) and fully reproducible from
# data/stations_network.json + data/storms/*.json track dates, so kept out
# of the repo. data/storms_obs/ (the converted per-storm JSON, produced by
# scripts/convert_amedas_csv.py from these CSVs) IS committed -- it's what
# the AMeDAS-network 風/雨 display mode actually loads at runtime.
/data/raw_amedas/

# Generated by scripts/download_jra3q_pressure.py. ~15GB for the full
# landfallJP month set, fully reproducible from data/index.json +
# data/storms/*.json track dates.
/data/raw_jra3q/

__pycache__/
